OL,3,GNEWSABurst water pipe forces schools to
OL,4,Ashut early
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree schools were forced to close
OL,7,Fearly after a burst water pipe left
OL,8,Fparts of the West Midlands without
OL,9,Fwater.
OL,11,FRedhill School, Ridgewood High School
OL,12,Fand The Wordsley School all told
OL,13,Fparents they would shut on Tuesday
OL,14,Fafternoon because of the disruption in
OL,15,FStourbridge.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
