OL,3,GNEWSABurst water pipe forces schools to
OL,4,Ashut early
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe problem also affected homes and
OL,7,Fbusinesses across the area, with Severn
OL,8,FTrent reporting that some customers
OL,9,Fwere experiencing no water, low
OL,10,Fpressure or discoloured supplies. A pub
OL,11,Fwas also among the premises forced to
OL,12,Fclose.
OL,14,FThe water company said the disruption
OL,15,Fwas down to a large burst pipe.
